            "review_text": "Mary\nVelez Rubio, Spain40 contributions\n1\nDisgusting Food and terrible service all busy on their phones.\nSep 2018 • Couples\nWhere shall I start? From start to finish was a disaster. Ordered tempura of King Prawns was overcooked and greasy. Chose fish same thing deep fried to beyond crispy and now I know why it was all overcooked! They are busy on their phones and forget what they are supposed to be doing.\n\nHad to try and get attention several times to discuss the concrete fish to no avail as they were all in zombie land on their phones. Explained the fish dryness to what I assume is a manager brought a scissors not sure what he wanted to cut. We sent it back and was rewarded with a platter of melon and guava yippee. \n\nDon't bother to enter this establishment go to the streets away from the from much better food. A terrible representation of Vietnamese food and we have eaten in pleat y places this was beyond worse.\nRead more\nWritten September 19, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
