            "review_text": "Naked D\n19 contributions\n1\nNot great service during lunch and food was not great either.\nSep 2018 • Couples\nNot sure where some of these reviews are from, but maybe we can at wrong time or ordered the wrong food. Server barely spoke to us. Took our order and brought food with no silverware or napkins. We had to call her back several times. I ordered the Thit Kho Tau (stewed pork dish with egg) and the egg was frozen previously, which you can tell from the egg white separating. We also ordered the Tom Rang Muoi (roaster shrimp with salt) which was ok and the Canh Rieu (vegetable soup with crab) had a very strong flavor and was hard to eat. I have had the same dish at other places, so I know it’s not always like that. The mango smoothies were very good, but that was pretty much the only thing we liked.\nRead more\nWritten September 11, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
